I"<p>We use files with content like this to load the environment variables needed to work in a local instance of oracle database.</p>

<div class="highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code>export ORACLE_SID=ORCL1
export ORACLE_UNQNAME=ORCL
